  "full_text": "So you youngsters will never have the thrill of Battlezone. I remember going on my bike to a superstore in Richland, Washington, getting into the little cabinet thing with the Battlezone and the rumble, the deep rumble. You will never have the thrill of Battlezone. That is the most glorious. As a little 12-year-old, as a little... I guess I was a Terminator kid or something. Whatever the fuck. So, like, nothing compares to that. So, this is a tribute to Battlezone. Because you've got to keep your morale up. Otherwise, your guys are like, God, this sucks, man. We don't get to kill nobody. We're fucking just out here. We're losers, man. This fucking sucks. You've got to give your... I don't know what goosebumps are. Maybe you get the Demolition Ranch to do USO. You know, whatever you call those guys. OSO, whatever the fuck, I don't remember, you know. UFO, no, no, USO. How about the Demo Ranch or some shit? How about like that, eh? Give a little Demo Ranch action. Okay, so that's all over, out.",
